Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}March 30, 2020.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A white ship, nearly 900 feet long, with red crosses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:09.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}on its sides, sails into New York Harbor.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 738 0 l 738 132 l 0 132{\p0}
