Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.25,0:00:07.00,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}USNS COMFORT ARRIVES · NEW YORK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Inside it is a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A thousand beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Twelve operating rooms. A CT scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:17.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And two plants that make their own oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:20.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Five days earlier, it was still loading supplies at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.86,0:00:21.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}a pier in Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:23.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Now it had come to a city in crisis.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.28,0:00:24.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
