Dialogue: 3,0:00:18.28,0:00:24.03,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MARCH 25, 2020 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:00:18.28,0:00:24.03,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LOADING AT NAVAL STATION NORFOLK, VA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:27.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}How do you build a hospital that can sail anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:30.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}in the world, and switch it on in five days?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:41.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Comfort began life as a supertanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:44.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It's one of two Mercy-class hospital ships, both
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:47.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}converted San Clemente-class tankers, built and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:50.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}converted by the National Steel and Shipbuilding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:51.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Company, in San Diego.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.39,0:00:45.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 674 0 l 674 132 l 0 132{\p0}
