Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The ship itself isn't run by Navy sailors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:29.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It's operated by about 70 civil service mariners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.80,0:01:33.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The hospital is staffed by up to 1,200 Navy medical
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.27,0:01:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and communications personnel.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.85,0:01:29.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 738 0 l 738 132 l 0 132{\p0}
