Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Most of the time, the ship waits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It's kept in what the Navy calls reduced operating
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:44.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}status, with a small crew of civilian mariners and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:47.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}active-duty personnel aboard.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:35.95,0:01:41.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
