Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:06.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It has digital radiology, a medical laboratory, a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:09.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}pharmacy, an optometry lab, and a CT scanner.
