Dialogue: 3,0:02:03.19,0:02:08.94,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}DISTINGUISHED VISITORS TOUR USNS COMFORT
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.09,0:02:10.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A 2017 U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Army video caption describes it as a seagoing level
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}three medical treatment facility, able to quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}provide basic surgery, care after surgery, and acute
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:25.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}medical care, for humanitarian crises and disaster relief.
