Dialogue: 3,0:02:10.34,0:02:16.09,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}HOSPITAL TOUR · USNS COMFORT
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At sea, patients can come aboard through side ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Or from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.65,0:02:42.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The flight deck can land large military helicopters.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.97,0:02:41.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
