Dialogue: 3,0:02:35.97,0:02:41.72,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MH-60S SEAHAWK ON USNS COMFORT'S FLIGHT DECK
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:45.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the same deck moves supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Here, during a 2025 mission, a Navy helicopter
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:50.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}carries pallets from the ship to the pier.
