Dialogue: 3,0:02:43.36,0:02:49.11,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SUPPLY OFFLOAD BY HELICOPTER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Today's Comfort is the third ship to carry that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:28.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The earlier ones served in the two world wars.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:23.05,0:03:28.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 695 0 l 695 132 l 0 132{\p0}
