Dialogue: 3,0:03:23.05,0:03:28.80,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}USNS COMFORT ARRIVES IN MIAMI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:32.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2017, after Hurricane Maria, it arrived in San
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:34.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Juan, Puerto Rico, on October 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Navy says it treated 1,899 patients on that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}mission, and performed 191 surgeries.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.02,0:05:33.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1038 0 l 1038 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:28.02,0:05:33.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
