Dialogue: 3,0:05:28.02,0:05:33.77,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}USNS COMFORT ARRIVES IN SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:54.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Two babies were born on board during that mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:56.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then came 2020.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 674 0 l 674 132 l 0 132{\p0}
