Dialogue: 3,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.71,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MARCH 28, 2020 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.71,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}USNS COMFORT DEPARTS NORFOLK
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:02.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}As COVID-19 spread, Comfort was sent to New York to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:05.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}serve as a referral hospital for patients who did
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}not have COVID.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:10.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That way, hospitals on shore could focus on COVID cases.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.48,0:06:05.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
