Dialogue: 3,0:05:59.48,0:06:05.23,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MARCH 25, 2020 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:05:59.48,0:06:05.23,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LOADING FOR NEW YORK · NAVAL STATION NORFOLK
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It left Norfolk on March 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:14.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Two days later, it tied up in Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}For this mission, more than 1,200 people were on board.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.27,0:06:17.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 610 0 l 610 132 l 0 132{\p0}
