Dialogue: 3,0:06:11.27,0:06:17.02,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MARCH 30, 2020 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:06:11.27,0:06:17.02,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARRIVING IN NEW YORK CITY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.70,0:06:21.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The first patient came aboard on April 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:33.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It worked alongside the Javits Center and hospitals
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}across New York and New Jersey.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:31.23,0:06:36.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 845 0 l 845 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:06:31.23,0:06:36.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:06:31.23,0:06:36.13,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}APRIL 30, 2020 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:06:31.23,0:06:36.13,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}USNS COMFORT DEPARTS NEW YORK HARBOR
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}For a thousand-bed ship, that's not a large number.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:10.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But it shows something about how these ships work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.27,0:07:13.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The plan can change in the middle of a mission, and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the hospital has to change with it.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.42,0:07:10.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 610 0 l 610 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:04.42,0:07:10.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:04.42,0:07:10.17,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}APRIL 30, 2020 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:07:04.42,0:07:10.17,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}DEPARTING NEW YORK HARBOR
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:18.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On April 30, Comfort left New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:21.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Two days later, it was back in Norfolk, returning to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:24.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}what the Navy calls Ready 5 status, ready for the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:25.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}next call.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.16,0:07:21.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 738 0 l 738 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:16.16,0:07:21.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:16.16,0:07:21.91,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MAY 2, 2020 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:07:16.16,0:07:21.91,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}RETURN TO NAVAL STATION NORFOLK
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:32.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Since 2007, the Navy has run a humanitarian mission
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:35.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}called Continuing Promise, in the Caribbean, and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:37.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Central and South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:40.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2025, it was the sixteenth one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:41.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Comfort's eighth.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:29.15,0:07:34.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1063 0 l 1063 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:29.15,0:07:34.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:29.15,0:07:34.90,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MIAMI · CARIBBEAN SEA · JUNE 2025 · U.S. AIR FORCE / U.S. ARMY
Dialogue: 3,0:07:29.15,0:07:34.90,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CONTINUING PROMISE 2025
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Much of the work happened on shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:06.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Teams set up medical sites ashore.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:03.05,0:08:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:03.05,0:08:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:03.05,0:08:07.00,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PUERTO PLATA, DOMINICAN REPUBLIC · JULY 16, 2025
Dialogue: 3,0:08:03.05,0:08:07.00,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SETTING UP A MEDICAL SITE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:10.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}There was medical care, eye care, and dentistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:14.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}At these shore sites, the teams saw 1,919 dental
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}patients, filled 17,166 prescriptions, and handed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:22.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}out more than 7,000 pairs of glasses and sunglasses.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.30,0:08:13.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 760 0 l 760 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:07.30,0:08:13.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:07.30,0:08:13.05,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JULY 29, 2025 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:08:07.30,0:08:13.05,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MEDICAL SITE · LIMÓN, COSTA RICA
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:26.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A dental assistant on the mission, Hospital Corpsman
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:28.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}3rd Class Cody Romero, put it simply.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And some patients came out to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:40.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Surgeons performed 242 surgeries on board.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.70,0:08:40.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 724 0 l 724 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:34.70,0:08:40.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:34.70,0:08:40.45,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}COLÓN, PANAMA · JUNE 28, 2025 · U.S. ARMY
Dialogue: 3,0:08:34.70,0:08:40.45,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SURGERY ABOARD USNS COMFORT
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.57,0:08:44.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Some of the work was done side by side with local
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:45.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}medical teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:49.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In five days in Panama, the team cared for 2,845
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:52.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}people, and the Navy counted 43 side-by-side
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:56.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}exchanges with Panamanian medical staff.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:40.82,0:08:46.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1081 0 l 1081 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:40.82,0:08:46.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:40.82,0:08:46.57,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JULY 16, 2025 · U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:08:40.82,0:08:46.57,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MEDICAL SITE · PUERTO PLATA, DOMINICAN REPUBLIC
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Even the equipment got care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.21,0:09:01.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The ship's biomedical technicians restored more than
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:04.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}2 million dollars' worth of medical equipment.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:56.78,0:09:02.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 824 0 l 824 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:56.78,0:09:02.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:56.78,0:09:02.53,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PORT OF SPAIN, TRINIDAD · AUG. 6, 2025
Dialogue: 3,0:08:56.78,0:09:02.53,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TOUR OF THE HOSPITAL · USNS COMFORT
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:48.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A hospital corpsman on board, Hospital Corpsman
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Second Class Malachi Gregory, described the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:54.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}to come down here and help people who otherwise
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:55.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}wouldn't be helped.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:45.45,0:09:51.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1385 0 l 1385 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:45.45,0:09:51.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:45.45,0:09:51.20,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CARIBBEAN SEA, JUNE 17 · PUERTO PLATA, D.R., JULY 16, 2025 · U.S. ARMY / U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:09:45.45,0:09:51.20,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FLIGHT DECK · USNS COMFORT
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:10:00.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On August 17, 2025, Comfort came home to Norfolk.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:55.88,0:10:00.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1273 0 l 1273 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:55.88,0:10:00.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:55.88,0:10:00.54,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CARIBBEAN SEA, JUNE · PUERTO PLATA, D.R., JULY 2025 · U.S. ARMY / U.S. NAVY
Dialogue: 3,0:09:55.88,0:10:00.54,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}USNS COMFORT FLIGHT DECK · CONTINUING PROMISE 2025
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:31.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Each of those missions needed the same things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.27,0:10:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A ship ready at a pier, and people ready to fill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:35.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:38.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A terrorist attack. Hurricanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:40.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}An earthquake. A pandemic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:44.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And in between, a promise, kept one port at a time.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.96,0:10:33.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 902 0 l 902 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:27.96,0:10:33.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:27.96,0:10:33.71,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}NEW YORK, MARCH 2020 · NORFOLK, MAY 2020 · U.S. NAVY
